35 Firs Avenue, London, England, N11 3NE
Email: support@travelsim.live
Phone: Available on our website travelsim.live for customer support inquiries.
We aim to respond to all inquiries within 48 hours. If you are dissatisfied with our response, you may lodge a complaint with the UK Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO) at www.ico.org.uk.
16. Governing Law
This Privacy Policy is governed by the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes arising from this policy shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.
By using our Platform or Services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to this Privacy Policy in its entirety.</pre>
